libinput-rs (1:0.3.5-1~ppa1~ubuntu26.04.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Retry fill_events on EINTR to permanently fix pointer freeze on
    signal delivery (e.g. SIGWINCH from terminal resize).
  * Packaging: add binutils Build-Depends, explicit libgfortran runtime dep.
  * CLI help text: add debug-tablet and debug-tablet-pad subcommands.
  * libinput-rs-chwd.8: add EXIT STATUS and EXAMPLES sections.
  * Fix udev rule and recovery service to target device 2-0015.

